<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Link expired</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; background: #f1f3f4; color: #202124; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; padding: 24px 16px; }
    .card { background: #fff; width: 100%; max-width: 560px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(60,64,67,.3), 0 4px 8px rgba(60,64,67,.15); overflow: hidden; }
    .bar { height: 8px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#4285F4,#34A853,#FBBC05,#EA4335); }
    .done { text-align: center; padding: 40px 24px; }
    .done .mark { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fce8e6; color: #d93025; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 18px; font-size: 34px; }
    .done h1 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .done p { font-size: 14px; color: #5f6368; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="bar"></div>
    <div class="done">
      <div class="mark">!</div>
      <h1>This link has expired</h1>
      <p>Ask the business to send you a new review link.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
